; OLD TUSK P1+ (S1 seam 3, sl-0104; docs/23 boss disposition — the
; Warden recipe is the floor): the tusk sweep — a 5-shot 70° heavy
; cone, short-lived, the boar's melee identity writ large. Elite
; amber language (Law 3: one elite shot family). Pattern id 22
; (namespace: 22..24 Old Tusk). Lead 30 rides the emitter slots.
; sl-0234 GEOMETRY FIX: spawn 0.5 -> 0.05 (blades are born INSIDE
; the 0.175 + 0.24 overlap disc — a player standing in him is hit by
; his own sweep, the exploit dies); ttl 16 -> 21 keeps the outer
; reach at 2.04 ~= the proven 2.07 so the mid-range fight is
; unchanged. [T].

